          <p data-i18n="home.holistic_sub" class="text-stone-600 text-base sm:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed"> Fostering holistic growth through traditional Buddhist culture, vibrant performing arts, and spirited athletics.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-10 sm:mb-20">
